# Shared knots: variable defaults and clock helpers.
# Every variable the story reads is given a value here, so a fact that
# hasn't happened yet is explicitly "not yet" rather than an accident.

=== tick
~ clk += tick_n
~ tick_n = 0
~ clock_str = clock(clk)
@time {clock_str}
return

=== drift
~ drift_from = clock_str
~ clk += tick_n
~ tick_n = 0
~ clock_str = clock(clk)
@drift {drift_from} {clock_str}
@time {clock_str}
return

